Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《Favourite Daughter》\N最爱的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a singer\N♪ 我曾是个歌手 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my fan\N♪ 你曾是我的粉丝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,When no one gave a damn\N♪ 当没人在乎的时候 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you in the dark\N♪ 是黑暗中的你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.99,0:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared of your anger\N♪ 畏惧你的怒火 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In love with your whim\N♪ 沉醉于你的随心所欲 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.23,0:00:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Some notes I don't hit\N♪ 有些音符我唱不上去 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't give up\N♪ 但我不会放弃 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every day\N♪ 如今每一天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,the plane takes off\N♪ 飞机起飞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And every night, the room fills up with\N♪ 每一夜，房间里都挤满了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,People who are convinced I'm not\N♪ 那些坚信我并非 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.05,0:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some kid fakin' it for your love\N♪ 只是为了你的爱而假装的孩子的人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.63,0:00:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm an actress\N♪ 因为我是个演员 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the medals I won for ya\N♪ 所有为你赢得的奖牌 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just to be your favourite daughter\N♪ 拼尽全力只为成为你最爱的女儿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.48,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run\N♪ 无论我奔向何方 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always runnin' to ya\N♪ 我总是奔向你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just hoping you'll say I'm a star\N♪ 拼尽全力只希望你说我是颗明星 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a brother, I look like him\N♪ 你有个兄弟，我长得像他 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us as kids\N♪ 你在我们还是孩子时这样说过 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"He diеd of a broken heart"\N♪ “他死于心碎” ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And for evеry door you open\N♪ 而你打开的每一扇门 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a room I can't go in\N♪ 都有一间我无法进入的房间 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I break in, I still can't find you\N♪ 我闯进去，却依然找不到你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that every day, the plane takes off\N♪ 如今每一天，飞机起飞 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And every night the room fills up\N♪ 每一夜房间都挤满人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell myself that soon we'll talk\N♪ 我告诉自己我们很快会聊聊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I sing every word just to ya\N♪ 然后我为你唱出每一个字 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm an actress, all of the medals I won for ya\N♪ 因为我是个演员，所有为你赢得的奖牌 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Panic attack just to be your favourite daughter\N♪ 恐慌发作只为成为你最爱的女儿 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.98,0:02:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya\N♪ 无论我奔向何方，我总是奔向你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back to carry the weight of your heart\N♪ 拼尽全力承载你内心的重量 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I keep dancing till I get sick\N♪ 但我一直跳舞直到感到不适 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to dream so big?\N♪ 你为何要拥有如此宏大的梦想？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did no one listen when you hit the notes from your heart?\N♪ 当你唱出内心的音符时，为何没人倾听？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah-ah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a good actress, look at the medals I won for ya\N♪ 我是个好演员，看看我为你赢得的奖牌 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So you could imagine being a favourite daughter\N♪ 这样你就能想象成为最爱的女儿的感觉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere I run, I'm always runnin' to ya\N♪ 无论我奔向何方，我总是奔向你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking my back just to be as brave as my mother\N♪ 拼尽全力只为像母亲一样勇敢 ♪